      "created_at": "2015-01-08T17:14:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I like Redirection vs. IL. &nbsp;it doesn't take many shots to bring him down, turn a few of his around and he's done.</p><p>Also anyone that can prevent villain damage like Tachyon, Wraith or Scholar are great, 1 round is generally enough to swing the fight.</p>",
