    {
      "id": 126077,
      "name": "phantaskippy",
      "username": "phantaskippy",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-01-11T17:59:52.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The important thing vs. IL is to buy rounds with cards like Mistbound, Throat Jab, Ground Pound, Grease Gun, etc.</p><p>Then find ways to turn damage around with redirection, counter-damage, and getting some irreducible damage on him.</p><p>He doesn't have much health, so getting his defense cleared and throat jabbing him can be a win.</p><p>The problem with IL is you have such limited time you need a few key cards or heroes that can pull what you need.</p><p>I love Sky-Scraper vs. IL, esp. paired with Fixer so you can hunt for Grease Gun and Jack-Handle and then IL is pretty much toast.</p><p>Jackhandle/Riveting Crane + Compulsion Canister is awesome.</p>",
      "post_number": 12,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:00:25.096Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
